[
  {
    "id": "delver_bye_01",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "farewell",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Leave yourself a way back.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_bye_01",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_bye_01.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_bye_01_v02",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "farewell",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Keep the return route clear in your head.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_bye_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_bye_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_bye_01_v03",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "farewell",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Come back with enough strength for the last stretch.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_bye_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_bye_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_bye_01_v04",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "farewell",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Go carefully, and remember the stairs.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_bye_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_bye_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_bye_01_v05",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "farewell",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Leave a little of yourself for the journey home.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_bye_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_bye_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_bye_01_v06",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "farewell",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Good travels. You still have to come back from them.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_bye_01",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_bye_01_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_active",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "A delivery to sort. Lift with both hands. Looking brave is no help to a dropped crate.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_active",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_active.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_active_v02",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "They're sorting a delivery. Two hands to a crate, please.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_active",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_active_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_active_v03",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "A delivery to sort. Keep a good hold before trying to look impressive.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_active",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_active_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_active_v04",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "Those crates need carrying. Bravery isn't a substitute for both hands.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_active",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_active_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_active_v05",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "We're sorting the delivery. A dropped crate doesn't care what you meant to prove.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_active",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_active_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_active_v06",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery active",
    "text": "The square has a delivery to sort. Hold the weight properly before taking a step.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_active",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_active_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_finished",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "The delivery has been received. A stack of crates that stays where you put it is a pleasant surprise.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_finished.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_finished_v02",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "The crates have arrived. I appreciate supplies that stay where they're set down.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_finished_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_finished_v03",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "Delivery received. None of those crates has tried to follow me. I like that.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_finished_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_finished_v04",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "The delivery is in. A quiet stack is an agreeable neighbor.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_finished_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_finished_v05",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "The crates are staying in the square for now. Predictable cargo makes a pleasant change.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_finished_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_delivery_finished_v06",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_local_life",
    "condition": "Local delivery finished",
    "text": "Everything's arrived. Those stacks are behaving better than some things I've met underground.",
    "variant_group": "delver_delivery_finished",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_delivery_finished_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_guild_01",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Your journal needs a way back as much as it needs a new discovery. Mark the stairs before you admire the ceiling.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_guild_01",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_guild_01.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_guild_01_v02",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Give the return route as much ink as the new discovery.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_guild_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_guild_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_guild_01_v03",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Mark the stairs for your guildmates before you write about the fine ceiling.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_guild_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_guild_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_guild_01_v04",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Your journal should help someone get home from the place you're describing.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_guild_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_guild_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_guild_01_v05",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "A page about a mystery is useful. So is the page that tells you how to leave.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_guild_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_guild_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_guild_01_v06",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_guild",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Leave the next Milewarden a way back. The marvel can have its own paragraph afterward.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_guild_01",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_guild_01_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_hello_01",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Sit if you're staying. My neck has retired, too.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_hello_01",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_hello_01.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_hello_01_v02",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Sit down. My neck gets tired before the conversation does.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_hello_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_hello_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_hello_01_v03",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "If you've got a story, bring it down to sitting height.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_hello_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_hello_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_hello_01_v04",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "I've retired from craning my neck. Take a seat.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_hello_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_hello_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_hello_01_v05",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "You can stand if you like. I'll be listening from here.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_hello_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_hello_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_hello_01_v06",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "greeting",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Staying a while? Sit. The road won't object.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_hello_01",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_hello_01_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_mage_01",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_training",
    "condition": "Mage or Spellsword",
    "text": "Blink still needs somewhere clear to put you. Remember that when you're frightened.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_mage_01",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_mage_01.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_mage_01_v02",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_training",
    "condition": "Mage or Spellsword",
    "text": "Blink needs a clear place to arrive. Fear doesn't make more room.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_mage_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_mage_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_mage_01_v03",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_training",
    "condition": "Mage or Spellsword",
    "text": "Before you Blink, look where you'll stand afterward.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_mage_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_mage_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_mage_01_v04",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_training",
    "condition": "Mage or Spellsword",
    "text": "A wall stays solid when you're frightened. Blink toward clear ground.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_mage_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_mage_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_mage_01_v05",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_training",
    "condition": "Mage or Spellsword",
    "text": "Find your landing place before you cast Blink.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_mage_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_mage_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_mage_01_v06",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_training",
    "condition": "Mage or Spellsword",
    "text": "Blink can get you out of trouble if you leave it somewhere clear to put you.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_mage_01",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_mage_01_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_memory_01",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_companions",
    "condition": "Once per speaker",
    "text": "My old crew argued over every meal. I miss the noise.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_memory_01",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_memory_01.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_memory_01_v02",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_companions",
    "condition": "Once per speaker",
    "text": "My crew could turn supper into an argument. I still miss hearing them.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_memory_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_memory_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_memory_01_v03",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_companions",
    "condition": "Once per speaker",
    "text": "I miss my old crew most at mealtimes. Nobody here argues quite the same way.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_memory_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_memory_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_memory_01_v04",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_companions",
    "condition": "Once per speaker",
    "text": "We argued over every meal on the road. I'd gladly hear it again.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_memory_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_memory_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_memory_01_v05",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_companions",
    "condition": "Once per speaker",
    "text": "A quiet supper makes me remember my crew. We were never quiet over food.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_memory_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_memory_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_memory_01_v06",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_companions",
    "condition": "Once per speaker",
    "text": "My companions found something to disagree about at every meal. I miss those voices.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_memory_01",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_memory_01_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_neighbors_01",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "My old crew brought five flags and one cooking pot. We learned which one mattered when it rained.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_neighbors_01.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_neighbors_01_v02",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "My crew carried five flags and a single cooking pot. Rain taught us which to worry about.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_neighbors_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_neighbors_01_v03",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Five flags in our packs. One cooking pot. We kept the pot dry first.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_neighbors_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_neighbors_01_v04",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "We brought five flags on the road and cooked in one pot. Bad weather made us practical.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_neighbors_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_neighbors_01_v05",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Rain didn't care about our five flags. Supper depended on the one pot.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_neighbors_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_neighbors_01_v06",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_neighbors",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "Our crew had five flags between us and one cooking pot. We all agreed about the pot when the rain came.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_neighbors_01",
    "variant": 6,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_neighbors_01_v06.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_ruin_01",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_ruins",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "A gate opening is a chance to leave as well as a chance to go deeper.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_ruin_01",
    "variant": 1,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_ruin_01.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_ruin_01_v02",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_ruins",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "When a gate opens, remember the way out.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_ruin_01",
    "variant": 2,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_ruin_01_v02.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_ruin_01_v03",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_ruins",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "An open gate gives you a choice. Leaving is one of them.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_ruin_01",
    "variant": 3,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_ruin_01_v03.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_ruin_01_v04",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_ruins",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "You needn't go deeper every time you can.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_ruin_01",
    "variant": 4,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_ruin_01_v04.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_ruin_01_v05",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_ruins",
    "condition": "Any",
    "text": "A gate that lets you onward also gives you a moment to decide.",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "variant_group": "delver_ruin_01",
    "variant": 5,
    "source_locale": "en",
    "text_key": "lore.delver_ruin_01_v05.text"
  },
  {
    "id": "delver_ruin_01_v06",
    "speaker": "retired_delver",
    "event": "topic_ruins",
